.TH batten-wiring-register 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-wiring\-register \- Register batten on the session root when a session is rooted above this repository
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten wiring register\fR [\fB\-\-check\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Register batten on the session root when a session is rooted above this repository
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fR
Exit non\-zero if a registration is owed, and write nothing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
